["What's the withdrawal fee?","Withdrawals carry a 10% fee, with a $100 minimum withdrawal amount. Buyer fees are always 0%."],
["What currencies can I use?","All payments and withdrawals are made in USDT (TRC20) or USDC (BEP20)."],
["What happens if I change my name, surname or country?","Any change to your legal name, surname or country requires you to reapply for KYC verification before you can withdraw or continue selling."],
["Do I need to verify a phone number?","Yes. You must bind and verify an SMS number in your Profile before requesting a withdrawal. Withdrawal OTPs are only ever sent to that verified number — you can't set a different number from the withdrawal form."],
["How much does a dispute cost?","Disputes cost 2 USDT/USDC. If the funds are split between both parties, each pays 1 USDT/USDC; if one party is found at fault, they pay the full 2."],
["How long until my funds are released?","Buyers have a three-day window to review a delivery. If no dispute is opened, the order enters a one-day clearance period before the seller balance is released."],
["Can I have more than one account?","No. Only one verified account per person is allowed — duplicate accounts are grounds for suspension."],
["How long do listing credits last?","Listing credits are annual — unused credits expire 12 months after purchase."],
["What happens if my account is suspended?","Suspended accounts cannot log in or receive sign-in codes until an administrator lifts the suspension."]
